msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sunlight—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫which she had not seen in some time—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was so bright it seemed "
"to burn her eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A luz do sol—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫que ela não via há algum tempo—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫era tão clara que parecia "
"queimar seus olhos."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
