msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EBBBBC96_08D4_4E6A_81C7_FE950D58835E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although the sun itself had not gotten any brighter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she had simply spent so much "
"time in the dark her eyes were no longer accustomed to that much light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora o próprio sol não tivesse ficado mais brilhante—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ela simplesmente passara "
"tanto tempo no escuro que seus olhos não estavam mais acostumados a tanta luz."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1743A20C_19DF_476A_BE0E_CF317A931797
